    {
      "target": "아이는 야채를 잘 안 먹어요.",
      "reading": "aineun yachaereul jal an meogeoyo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "The child doesn’t eat vegetables very well.",
        "ko": "아이는 야채를 잘 안 먹어요.",
        "ipa": "aineun yachaereul jal an meogeoyo.",
        "ar": "الطفل لا يأكل الخضار جيدًا.",
        "cs": "Dítě moc nejí zeleninu.",
        "da": "Barnet spiser ikke ret mange grøntsager.",
        "de": "Das Kind isst nicht gern Gemüse.",
        "el": "Το παιδί δεν τρώει πολύ καλά τα λαχανικά.",
